# Monorepo environment guide
#
# This file is a placeholder showing global toggles. Prefer package-specific env files:
# - packages/extension/.env.development and .env.production (Vite client variables)
# - packages/server/.env (Node server variables)
#
# Edition switch controls OSS vs Pro behavior in shared code.
# In Vite (extension), use VITE_EDITION. In Node (server), use EDITION.
# Valid values: 'open-source' or 'pro'
#
# Server (Node):
EDITION=open-source
# Extension (Vite): uncomment and set if you need to override at build time
# VITE_EDITION=open-source
